  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You hurl three shards of ice at one target within range or at several. Make a ranged spell attack for each shard; on a hit, the target takes 3d6 Cold damage, and on a Critical Hit it also has the &amp;Reference[restrained apply=false]{Restrained} condition until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You create one additional shard for each spell slot level above 3.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-WIbMF5Mb4EQKED5u\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Make one attack per shard; apply the Restrained effect on a Critical Hit.</p></section>",
